item.description:
In the wake of NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang’s stunning resignation, many are asking how an alleged Chinese spy was able to reportedly get so close to one of Silicon Valley’s most influential executives. As President Donald Trump prepares for another trip to China this week, we talk to someone who used to investigate corporate espionage in Silicon Valley about how AI firms will need to rethink how they do security going forward.&nbsp;

---&nbsp;

Guests: Phil Mattingly, CNN Chief Domestic Correspondent and Anchor & Frank Figluizzi, former FBI Assistant Director&nbsp;

Host/Producer: David Rind&nbsp;

Showrunner: Felicia Patinkin
